  "$comment": "CDrus name-hint keyword table (RFC §4.1.1). Derived from the CDEvents subject/predicate catalog in schemas/cdevents. A subject appears here with its full predicate set; `begin`/`end` name the begin/end predicate pair for subjects that have one (both null for flat-predicate subjects). Hint evaluation is performed against a declared table version; a new table version governs new publications and must not retroactively invalidate expressions already accepted. Update via a reviewed table-version bump, never by hot-swapping.",
